  title: 'Research and Grant Management Specialist (Ndera Hospital) — Mock Exam 3',
  summary:
    'Full-length practice covering investment appraisal and financial/economic modelling, resource mobilisation and partnership negotiation, Rwanda\'s public financial management and national budget context, time management and conceptual capacity, numerical/analytical reasoning, and a linked PPP feasibility case study.',
