  slug: 'cpd-coordination-officer-ndera-mock-exam-2',
  title: 'CPD Coordination Officer (Ndera Hospital) — Mock Exam 2',
  summary:
    'Full-length practice covering CPD programme design (ADDIE, Kirkpatrick, quality-improvement cycles), digital literacy and resource management, mentorship and coaching, adaptability and stakeholder communication, numerical/analytical reasoning, and a linked case study on migrating CPD records to a digital system.',
  free: false,
