  slug: 'postgraduate-coordination-officer-ndera-mock-exam-2',
  title: 'Postgraduate Coordination Officer (Ndera Hospital) — Mock Exam 2',
  summary:
    'Full-length practice covering curriculum and learning outcomes, trainee research and thesis supervision, trainee welfare and duty-hour management, multi-stakeholder coordination, decision-making and numerical reasoning, and a linked case study on a cohort duty-hour compliance audit.',
  free: false,
